From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spike <spike@local>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:43:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] wasm(net,blob,time): ws_tcp transport, wasm clocks, blob
 sync_fs, fetch

- net/ws_tcp.rs: TCP over the WebSocket bridge (/dns, /tcp endpoints),
  TLS stays in wasm.
- tools::time_now()/time_elapsed() and SystemTimeTools re-export replace
  Time::now() call sites (native delegates to std unchanged).
- blob: sync_fs facade (std::fs natively, memfs on wasm); image_metadata
  reads through BufRead + Seek so memfs works (target-neutral refactor,
  byte-for-byte identical recode output - avatar golden unchanged).
- deltachat-ratelimit uses the wasm-safe clock.

WASM-CORE: prototype 0005, 0006, 0007, 0010 (MPL ideas).
Native impact: mechanical call-site refactors, no behaviour change
(full lib nextest 1135/1135 on the copy).
